/// Does framed mode expose the command shell that `windows-usage.md`
/// documents (`help`, `ls`, `ps`, `run counter`)? In plain mode the target
/// offers only a numeric menu and answers `ps -l` with BAD, so this is the
/// prediction that negotiation is what unlocks it.
